BUILD ORDER
1. Create folders.
2. Paste root files.
3. Paste web/index.html.
4. Add assets folders and screenshots.
5. Paste models and sample data.
6. Paste shared theme, utils, and widgets.
7. Paste feature pages.
8. Paste app bootstrap files.
9. Paste deploy.yml.
10. Paste README.md.
11. Run flutter pub get.
12. Run flutter run -d chrome.
13. Run flutter build web --release --base-href "/superhero_android_developer_v4_pro_max/"
14. Push to main.
15. Verify GitHub Actions deploy.
16. Open the live GitHub Pages URL.

